{"type":"message","id":"42c516e5","parentId":"5266923d","timestamp":"2026-05-23T16:05:30.299Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the GET works fine but POST returns 1101. The headers say POST is allowed (access-control-allow-methods: GET, POST, OPTIONS), but the POST fails. Let me check if maybe the content field needs to be formatted differently, or if there's a max length constraint.\n\nThe 1101 error seems like an application-level error, not an HTTP error. Let me try a minimal payload.","thinkingSignature":"4df7d95a47972a00206afebe2ce136d22c44baa23f6384ddee31aeb09917870f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6rur7l4tr8xb_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Test\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":503,"output":175,"cacheRead":24768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25446,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779552326629,"responseId":"066103473e847228da03c59b465cc5d5"}}
