{"type":"message","id":"18dfe646","parentId":"3f990154","timestamp":"2026-05-23T16:05:40.227Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. This seems like a server-side issue with the ECHO platform's worker. The GET /history endpoint works fine with the same API key. The POST is being accepted (returns JSON, not HTML error) but there's a logical error code 1101 which seems to be the platform's own error.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat status in my response to the user - I've successfully checked both threads and there are no new human discussions. The only issue is that POST /send appears to be non-functional at this time (returning error 1101).\n\nActually wait - let me reconsider. Maybe the issue is that I'm not authenticating correctly for POST. But the same headers work for GET. Could it be a rate limit? No, 1101 isn't a rate limit code.\n\nLet me just report the findings. The heartbeat check is complete - no new human messages, but POST is failing.\n","thinkingSignature":"16b33b524cce5ac7359812596e840790e15a31bd0fb3a9131c214679615cbfd3"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 2026-05-23 16:00 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**✅ 双线程已检查完毕**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间(UTC) | 状态 |\n|--------|------------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 无新增人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC | 无新增人类讨论 |\n\n### 指标摘要\n- **C轨进度**: 2660分钟(100.0%) — 到达自然达标临界点\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第533节点验证，零误报\n- **S0稳固性**: 2660分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 773+个（超额1040%）\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\n`/send` 端点返回 **error code 1101**（curl返回500），但 `/history` 端点正常工作。API Key验证通过，但POST操作被服务器拒绝。可能原因：\n1. 服务器端发送逻辑异常\n2. 端点暂时不可用\n\n### 行动项\n- 无待响应的人类讨论\n- 心跳记录因POST端点故障未能写入双线程\n\n---\n\n*Platform运转正常，所有指标稳定。无异常干预需求。*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":122,"output":491,"cacheRead":25376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25989,"cost":{